    <li>Discord Server — Chat with the team and other contributors</li>
    <li><a href="/docs/en/contributing/rfc-process/">RFC Process</a> — Propose and discuss significant changes</li>
    <li>Roadmap — See what's planned and what's in progress</li>
  </ul>

